================================================================================
Bundled dependencies
================================================================================

The executable jar produced by this project embeds its dependencies. The two
that are worth calling out here:

  whisper-ffm  (jp.clip:whisper-ffm)
    https://github.com/juju351nicu/whisper-ffm
    Copyright 2026 juju351nicu
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

    Its jar bundles the whisper.cpp shared libraries (whisper, ggml, ggml-base,
    ggml-cpu) and the silero VAD model, both under the MIT License. The full
    MIT text ships inside that jar as META-INF/LICENSE-whisper.cpp.txt, along
    with its own LICENSE and NOTICE.

  Spring Boot / Spring Shell
    https://spring.io/projects/spring-boot
    Copyright 2012-2026 the original author or authors
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

External programs invoked as separate processes - ffmpeg, whisper-ctranslate2,
openai-whisper and whisper-cli - are NOT distributed with this project. They are
installed and licensed separately by the user.
